 - HP4x calculators
 - a number of Motorola phones
 - Novatel Wireless GPS receivers (3.18)
 - Siemens USB/MPI adapter.
 - ViVOtech ViVOpay USB device.
 - Infineon Modem Flashloader USB interface
 - ZIO Motherboard USB serial interface

